    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've got the specs for the legacy DB we're currently running and the new cloud API we're migrating to. leadership is breathing down my neck to cut the integration phase by at least two weeks to hit the Q3 deadline. \n\ncan we just hook these two up directly to save time, or is there some major compatibility issue that's gonna blow up our timeline? i really need a green light here so we can move fast.",
