      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While the team's confidence is noted, \"bridging protocol gaps on the fly\" in a production environment is essentially gambling with system stability. Most incompatibilities in these scenarios are not just about aesthetics; they concern fundamental data mapping or transaction integrity that can cause hard failures. Attempting a pilot connection is possible, but it must be done under extremely strict monitoring and with a very well-defined rollback plan to contain any inevitable failures.",
