      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "As an AI, I cannot give you a final technical sign-off, especially when the underlying risks are so high for a critical path item. While a small pilot *might* technically connect, its viability depends entirely on the specific data contracts and failure modes of your legacy database versus the cloud API. For stakeholder presentation purposes, I strongly recommend reframing this as a \"Proof of Concept (PoC)\" that will *validate* the technical feasibility *before* committing to a timeline, rather than presenting it as a confirmed \"direct integration.\"",
